Start the program.
Accept the number of metro stations.
Assign a name or number to each station.
Initialize the adjacency matrix with zeros.
Accept the number of direct connections between stations.
For each connection, set matrix[i][j] = 1 and matrix[j][i] = 1.
Display the adjacency matrix.
Accept the station number selected by the user.
Check the corresponding row of the matrix.
Display all stations whose matrix value is 1.
Stop the program.
